# Local screen-lock emergency reset code (web client).
# The tracked file always shipped with an EMPTY resetCodeHash, so nothing has
# leaked — but tracking it means the first operator to configure a real code
# commits their own reset hash by accident. The template is tracked instead.
fates-edge-web-client/data/lock-reset.json
